            <p>Help restore and maintain local community gardens to provide fresh produce to families in need.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <h3>Youth Literacy Program</h3>
            <p>Volunteer as a reading mentor for children in elementary schools across the district.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <h3>Park Cleanup Initiative</h3>
            <p>Join monthly cleanup events to keep public parks safe, clean, and beautiful for everyone.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <h3>Food Bank Volunteer Drive</h3>
            <p>Assist in sorting, packing, and distributing food donations at local food banks.</p>
        </li>
    </ul>
</main>

